The Prime Minister, Shri Narendra Modi has met former President Shri Ram Nath Kovind & his family and extended greetings to them on the auspicious occasion of Diwali.
In a post on X, Shri Modi said;
“Met former President Shri Ram Nath Kovind Ji and his family. Wished them on the auspicious occasion of Diwali.
@ramnathkovind”
Met former President Shri Ram Nath Kovind Ji and his family. Wished them on the auspicious occasion of Diwali.

@ramnathkovind https://t.co/mwtL66W7iB
— Narendra Modi (@narendramodi)
November 8, 2026
